  "notes": "The 450 t rating is over the rear only (16.1 m, 3 m); '*' sub-column excluded; 360° max 201.5 t. The source table has 26 boom lengths incl. alternative telescoping modes (32.8, 44.3, 49.6, 55.8, 61.1, 66.4 m ... have much lower capacities); 12 of the higher-capacity lengths kept, omitted: 32.8, 44.3, 49.6, 55.8, 61.1, 66.4, 68.9, 71.7, 73.5, 77, 78.8, 79.5, 82.2, 84.1 m. IMPORTANT: cells colour-shaded by required VarioBallast radius (5/6/7 m) - not encoded; check source. Outrigger span from p.3: longitudinal 10414 mm (6019+4395; other side 10389), transverse 9600 mm (partial 7950/6120). Max supporting force 203.4 t (p.7; other 154.5 t). operatingWeight_t = on-road <96 t (8 x 12 t) (p.11). Max hook height not stated numerically for T boom. Hook block weight is part of the load. Telescopic boom: 1 base + 6 telescopic sections."
